Project-specific Alembic migrations for the PostgreSQL schema.

Run from `backend/`:

    .\venv\Scripts\alembic.exe upgrade head

Migration versions live in `backend/alembic/versions/`. Import every SQLAlchemy
model in `backend/alembic/env.py` so Alembic can see the complete metadata.

Read `docs/architecture/system-architecture.md` for the current data model and
`docs/guides/database-setup-guide.md` for the historical bootstrap walkthrough.
